name productbox
category Package
revision 20886
shortdesc Typeset a three-dimensional product box
relocated 1
longdesc The package enables typesetting of a three-dimensional product
longdesc box. This product box can be rendered as it is standing on a
longdesc surface and some light is shed onto it. Alternatively it can be
longdesc typeset as a wireframe to be cut out and glued together. This
longdesc will lead to a physical product box. The package requires pgf
longdesc and TikZ.
runfiles size=7
